+| Graphs / P2P | Opt-in class capability makes native FULL variants downgrade to PIECEWISE; eager/NONE also available | Python per-layer hooks must execute; no full-graph bypass of transfer hooks; capture/replay unverified |
+| Benchmark bridge | A/B/B2/B3/C/D/S2 completion/chat, existing trace replay, explicit campaign/pipeline, monitoring/analysis | Not an unchanged legacy-shell runner, non-vLLM backend or multimodal-loader bridge; those upstream/artifact facilities remain separately retained |
